[38;5;10mtranslation/Cargo.toml[0m declares no [38;5;10m[features][0m table, and [38;5;10mc_src/CMakeLists.txt[0m has no conditional compilation, options, or [38;5;10mtarget_compile_definitions[0m. So there is exactly one valid configuration — the empty feature set. [38;5;10mverify.sh[0m derives this from Cargo.toml programmatically (powerset of the [38;5;10m[features][0m table) rather than hardcoding it, so it will pick up features if any are added. No [38;5;10m#[cfg(feature = ...)][0m gating was needed.[0m[0m
