The public API is a single function, [38;5;10mjumpnode[0m. [38;5;10mnm -D[0m shows the C [38;5;10m.so[0m exports only that symbol; the helpers are [38;5;10mstatic[0m (local [38;5;10mt[0m/[38;5;10mb[0m symbols). Critically, [38;5;10minitialize_test_data[0m is [38;5;10mstatic[0m and never called, so [38;5;10mnode_count[0m is permanently [38;5;10m0[0m in the shipped library — which means modes [38;5;10m0001[0m, [38;5;10m0002[0m, and [38;5;10m0004[0m always take their [38;5;10mfind_node_by_id() == NULL[0m early-return and yield the constants 18, 34, and 66. Most of the translated code is unreachable through the exported API.[0m[0m
