I hit a false positive worth flagging: the internals tests initially failed with a control-flow mismatch. The cause was my harness, not the translation — [38;5;10mdlopen[0m on the same path returns one refcounted handle, so the parallel test threads were all mutating the same [38;5;10mnode_count[0m. A standalone probe reproducing the exact inputs matched. Fixed by loading the pair once behind a [38;5;10mOnceLock<Mutex<..>>[0m.[0m[0m
