Two spots are genuine C UB that I scoped deliberately rather than asserting on: [38;5;10mprocess_backward[0m with a negative [38;5;10mstart_offset[0m reads below the array, so the harness hands it a padded buffer with the pointer aimed at the middle — every offset tested stays inside one allocation, keeping the comparison well-defined. Through [38;5;10mjumpnode[0m itself, mode [38;5;10m0002[0m's [38;5;10mdepth[0m is kept non-negative for the same reason, since there the array is a stack local whose surrounding bytes have no defined value. The other modes are swept with negative depths.[0m[0m
